{"seq":21,"slug":"huawei","title":"华为企业管理与组织文化","stage":"DONE","category":"corporate-management","chapterCount":7,"docCount":29,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei","rating":{"composite":3.97,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.21,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 华为企业管理与组织文化 简介\n\n华为技术有限公司由任正非于1987年在深圳创立，从一家注册资本仅2.1万元的小型交换机代理商，成长为全球领先的ICT基础设施和智能终端提供商。截至2024年，华为拥有超过20万名员工，年营收突破8600亿元人民币，业务遍及170多个国家和地区。\n\n华为的成功不仅源于技术创新，更根植于其独特的管理体系和组织文化。从1998年颁布的《华为基本法》到持续演进的治理架构，华为构建了一套以\"客户为中心、以奋斗者为本、长期艰苦奋斗\"为核心的管理哲学。这套体系涵盖了价值创造、价值评价和价值分配的完整闭环，成为中国企业管理的重要标杆。\n\n本知识库从四个维度系统解析华为的管理实践：\n\n**第一章 文化与价值观**深入剖析《华为基本法》的制度化思想、以客户为中心的经营哲学，以及狼性文化与艰苦奋斗精神的内涵与演变。\n\n**第二章 绩效体系**聚焦末位淘汰与活力曲线机制、获取分享制与绩效承诺（PBC）体系，以及干部四象限评价与干部管理体系。\n\n**第三章 组织与人才**解读轮值CEO/轮值董事长的权力分享制度、全员持股与TUP激励机制，以及人才梯队建设与\"选、用、留、流\"策略。\n\n**第四章 战略与方法论**分析IPD集成产品开发流程、LTC线索到现金流程与铁三角协作模式，以及灰度哲学与开放妥协的管理智慧。\n\n适合对企业管理、组织设计、人力资源、战略管理感兴趣的读者，尤其适合希望从华为实践中汲取管理灵感的创业者、管理者和研究者。建议按照文化基础→绩效体系→组织架构→战略方法的顺序学习，逐层深入理解华为管理的系统性和内在逻辑。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"huawei-basic-law","title":"华为基本法：制度化的管理纲领","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/culture-and-values/huawei-basic-law"},{"seq":2,"slug":"customer-centricity","title":"以客户为中心的核心哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/culture-and-values/customer-centricity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wolf-culture","title":"狼性文化与艰苦奋斗精神","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/culture-and-values/wolf-culture"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-and-vision","title":"华为的使命与愿景演变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/culture-and-values/mission-and-vision"},{"seq":5,"slug":"core-values-system","title":"华为核心价值观体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/culture-and-values/core-values-system"},{"seq":6,"slug":"culture-in-practice","title":"华为文化落地机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/culture-and-values/culture-in-practice"},{"seq":7,"slug":"ren-zhengfei-thought","title":"任正非管理思想与文化基因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/culture-and-values/ren-zhengfei-thought"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-system","title":"绩效体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/performance-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"last-place-elimination","title":"末位淘汰与活力曲线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/performance-system/last-place-elimination"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gain-sharing","title":"获取分享制与绩效承诺（PBC）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/performance-system/gain-sharing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cadre-management","title":"干部四象限与干部管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/performance-system/cadre-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"org-and-talent","title":"组织与人才","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/org-and-talent","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rotating-leadership","title":"轮值CEO与轮值董事长制度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/org-and-talent/rotating-leadership"},{"seq":2,"slug":"employee-stock-tup","title":"全员持股与TUP激励","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/org-and-talent/employee-stock-tup"},{"seq":3,"slug":"talent-echelon","title":"人才梯队与\"选、用、留、流\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/org-and-talent/talent-echelon"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy-and-methodology","title":"战略与方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/strategy-and-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ipd-process","title":"IPD集成产品开发流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/strategy-and-methodology/ipd-process"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ltc-iron-triangle","title":"LTC流程与铁三角模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/huawei/strategy-and-methodology/ltc-iron-triangle"},{"seq":3,"slug":"grey-philosophy","title"